+    The numbers TESS-2310 turned on, pinned: the shadow report's
+    `training_nonzero_share` of 0.2743 was the leaky feature on training rows,
+    and its `shadow_nonzero_share` of 0.1419 was the point-in-time feature on
+    the scored window. Two different features, one name.
+    """
+    split = temporal_split(repo_data)
+    leaky = card_chargeback_rate_whole_table(repo_data)
+    point_in_time = card_chargeback_rate(repo_data, repo_data["timestamp"])
